          "author": "Carole Lindstrom, illustrated by Michaela Goade",
          "description": "This program is read by the author. Inspired by the many Indigenous-led movements across North America, We Are Water Protectors issues an urgent rallying cry to safeguard the Earth’s water from harm and corruption—a bold and lyrical audiobook written by Carole Lindstrom.  Water is the first medicine. It affects and connects us all . . .  When a black snake threatens to destroy the Earth And poison her people’s water, one young water protector Takes a stand to defend Earth’s most sacred resource. A Macmillan Audio production from Roaring Brook Press.",
